1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,200
Heard of them

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,066
People from the Fu Group

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,000
Looks like they're not waiting for my text

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:10,866
You don't have to go

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,266
Why wouldn't I

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,233
They want to confirm

7
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:14,433
I want to know too

8
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,866
Then I'll go with you

9
00:00:16,666 --> 00:00:18,266
Aren't you afraid I'll leave with the Fu Group

10
00:00:18,766 --> 00:00:19,566
A little bit

11
00:00:20,033 --> 00:00:21,033
Status can change

12
00:00:21,066 --> 00:00:23,100
But our marriage certificate won't

13
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,633
Let's go, Mrs. Fu

14
00:00:24,966 --> 00:00:26,633
You say that so naturally lately

15
00:00:26,766 --> 00:00:27,566
It's legal

16
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:37,300
Mr. Fu

17
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,966
This is Elder Qin from the Fu Consortium

18
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,800
I've heard a lot about you, Mr. Fu

19
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,233
Elder Qin, the Gu Group provided some additional materials

20
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,700
But the payment uncertainty issue remains unresolved

21
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,000
What's your take, Mr. Fu

22
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,100
Mr. Lu

23
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:51,066
Now at every project meeting

24
00:00:51,066 --> 00:00:52,200
we always have to ask Fu Chenzhou

25
00:00:52,766 --> 00:00:54,200
Someone who can spot the problem

26
00:00:54,433 --> 00:00:55,633
Is of course worth asking

27
00:00:59,766 --> 00:01:00,000
The materials are more complete this time
